Subject: [PATCH] curl: skip runtime library verification on iOS

curl's configure-time runtime library probe is not meaningful for the iOS
cross build. Drop the probe while leaving the rest of configure.ac intact.

diff -ruN -U1 --exclude=*.bak a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
--- a/configure.ac	2024-03-26 15:05:31
+++ b/configure.ac	2026-07-05 00:14:03
@@ -3609,3 +3609,2 @@
 CURL_CHECK_STRUCT_TIMEVAL
-CURL_VERIFY_RUNTIMELIBS
